# OpenRouter API key — used by the AI teacher to score sentences.
# Get a free key at https://openrouter.ai/keys
#
# ⚠️ This file is documentation only. The current build reads the API key from
# browser localStorage (key = `three_word_sentence.apiKey`) entered via the
# in-app setup screen. The Vite env variable below is intentionally NOT
# consumed by any code; it is kept as a hint for future env-based workflows.
VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-your-key-here